                    "id": 3488,
                    "name": "MELTA 1",
                    "rules": "This ability always takes the form <b>[MELTA X]</b>. Each time a model makes an attack with a <b>[MELTA]</b> weapon, if the target unit was within half range of that weapon in the Select Targets step, until the attacking unit’s attacks have been resolved, add <b>X</b> to that weapon’s <b>D</b> characteristic.\n\n<b>Example:</b> <i>A model targets a unit that is within half range of a <b>[MELTA 2]</b> weapon with a <b>D</b> characteristic of D6. While resolving those attacks, that weapon has a <b>D</b> characteristic of D6+2 </i>"
